  "description": "Managed by chezmoi from kosako/dotfiles (otel-backend module, #525). The telemetry of Claude Code (events in Loki) received by the local otel-lgtm; claude-settings sends it (enableClaudeTelemetry, #523). Edit the JSON in dotfiles, not in the UI.",
